@crew v-upton-iver
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Iver Upton. Thirty years on a freighter. Now I'm a passenger. Odd.
- Ah. A junior. Good. Juniors keep a ship honest.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I told your Captain how to run her ship. She thanked me. Kindly.   #funny
?

== chat
- Thirty years of cargo. This is my first ship where somebody plays the piano.
- Calling home tonight. They've kept my chair. My grandson's in it.   #funny

== near
? place:lounge
- Best window on any ship I've known. And I've known a few.
? place:booths
- Calling home. Thirty years I made them wait. Not any more.   #warm
?

== bye
- {bye}. Listen to your chiefs. Then make your own mind up.

== smalltalk
- Hm. Tidy ship.
- Thirty years. Fancy.
